<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Pioneer still considering acquisition.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Pioneer still considering acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian building materials group Pioneer International Ltd said on Friday it hoped to make a major acquisition in the next year, adding that it had been in talks about possible acquisitions.</p>
<p>Asked if an acquisition would happen in the next 12 months Pioneer chief executive John Schubert told reporters: &quot;I would hope so, but I am not going to give any time frame.&quot;</p>
<p>&quot;There are a number of things we are talking to people about at the moment, but it is relatively early stages and some of those things if they happen could take three or four months or longer,&quot; Schubert said after the company's annual meeting.</p>
</text>
